H 7.8 prior to being resuspended in 25 mM Tris-HCl pH 7.8. On-bead trypsin digestion was performed followed by desalting using C18 columns (Pierce). Proteomic profiling was performed by liquid chromatography tandem mass spectrometry (LC-MS/MS) using an Easy nLC 1200 coupled to a QExactive HF mass spectrometer (Thermo).\n'}], 'model': 'gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17', 'store': True, 'temperature': 0.3}}
